; Title atlas (splash and title screens; authored by Claude as code, compiled by tools/pixelart.py).
; title_cauldron: 112x86 iron cauldron, rim opening centred at (56, 15), handles either side, brass band, three feet.
; title_liquid_0..2: the bubbling surface on the same canvas (same anchor), neutral v body / 9 shade / 7 bubble
; rims: draw it over the pot with `modulate` set to a potion colour. title_fire_0..2: 84x26 logs and flames,
; drawn behind the pot centred under it. logo: "BrewMagic" (Brew gold, Magic violet), two-tone outline, shadow.
; bubble_small / bubble_big / steam_puff: white particle textures, tinted by the particles' colour.

